    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 20(5) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, the ConsumerAffairs Authority Orders that no producer, importer, distributor or trader shall sell, expose or offer for sale or display for salethe following varieties of rice above the Maximum Retail Price given hereunder ;",
